{{!
    @template tool_activitydates/modtable

    Table of a course's activities of one module type: their current dates,
    the sessions they are scheduled into, and, for selected and scheduled
    activities, editable open/(due)/close dates filled with the proposed values.
    The date inputs sit outside the moodleform and carry form="formid" so they
    post with it.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-previewtable" with data-formid - the table wrapper
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-stale" - the stale-settings bar
    * data-cmid, data-field - on each date input and its hint
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-hint" - the inline hint after each date input

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formid string - the id of the moodleform the inputs submit with
    * fingerprint string - the settings fingerprint the table was built from
    * hasdue bool - whether the type has due dates (Due column)
    * modname string - the module type name (e.g. quiz), used in the activity links
    * showquestioncount bool - whether to show the question count column
    * colcount int - number of visible columns, drives the session header colspan
    * editcolspan int - number of editable date columns, spanned by the status text
    * tabledata array - list of header and activity rows
      * isheader bool - true for a session header row
      * dates object - the session window (absent when the session is not scheduled)
        * sessionnumber int - the 1-based session number
        * startformatted string - session open date formatted for display
        * startattr string - session open date for the time element's datetime attribute
        * endformatted string - session close date formatted for display
        * endattr string - session close date for the time element's datetime attribute
      * id int - the course module id (activity rows)
      * name string - the activity name (activity rows)
      * intro string - the activity description (activity rows)
      * selected string - "checked" when the activity is selected (activity rows)
      * questioncount int - number of questions (quiz activity rows)
      * timeopen int - current open timestamp, 0 when unset (activity rows)
      * timeopenformatted string - current open date formatted for display, empty when unset
      * timeopenattr string - current open date for the datetime attribute, empty when unset
      * duedate int - current due timestamp, 0 or null when unset (activity rows)
      * duedateformatted string - current due date formatted for display, empty when unset
      * duedateattr string - current due date for the datetime attribute, empty when unset
      * timeclose int - current close timestamp, 0 when unset (activity rows)
      * timecloseformatted string - current close date formatted for display, empty when unset
      * timecloseattr string - current close date for the datetime attribute, empty when unset
      * editable bool - whether the row has editable date inputs (selected and scheduled)
      * statustext string - what Save does to a non-editable row
      * timeopenvalue string - the open input's value (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM or empty)
      * timeopeninvalid bool - whether the open value failed validation
      * timeopenerror string - the open value's error message
      * duedatevalue string - the due input's value
      * duedateinvalid bool - whether the due value failed validation
      * duedateerror string - the due value's error message
      * timeclosevalue string - the close input's value
      * timecloseinvalid bool - whether the close value failed validation
      * timecloseerror string - the close value's error message

    Example context (json):
    {
        "formid": "tool_activitydates_dates_form",
        "fingerprint": "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567",
        "hasdue": true,
        "modname": "quiz",
        "showquestioncount": true,
        "colcount": 8,
        "editcolspan": 3,
        "tabledata": [
            {
                "isheader": true,
                "dates": {
                    "sessionnumber": 1,
                    "startformatted": "Fri 05 Jan 2024 10:00",
                    "startattr": "2024-01-05T10:00",
                    "endformatted": "Fri 12 Jan 2024 10:00",
                    "endattr": "2024-01-12T10:00"
                }
            },
            {
                "isheader": false,
                "id": 56,
                "name": "Quiz 1",
                "intro": "First quiz",
                "selected": "checked",
                "questioncount": 5,
                "timeopen": 1704447600,
                "timeopenformatted": "Fri 05 Jan 2024 10:00",
                "timeopenattr": "2024-01-05T10:00",
                "duedate": 0,
                "duedateformatted": "",
                "duedateattr": "",
                "timeclose": 1705052400,
                "timecloseformatted": "Fri 12 Jan 2024 10:00",
                "timecloseattr": "2024-01-12T10:00",
                "editable": true,
                "statustext": "",
                "timeopenvalue": "2024-01-05T10:00",
                "timeopeninvalid": false,
                "timeopenerror": "",
                "duedatevalue": "2024-01-05T09:00",
                "duedateinvalid": true,
                "duedateerror": "The due date must be after the open date.",
                "timeclosevalue": "2024-01-12T10:00",
                "timecloseinvalid": false,
                "timecloseerror": ""
            },
            {
                "isheader": false,
                "id": 57,
                "name": "Quiz 2",
                "intro": "",
                "selected": "",
                "questioncount": 3,
                "timeopen": 0,
                "timeopenformatted": "",
                "timeopenattr": "",
                "duedate": 0,
                "duedateformatted": "",
                "duedateattr": "",
                "timeclose": 0,
                "timecloseformatted": "",
                "timecloseattr": "",
                "editable": false,
                "statustext": "Not scheduled"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div data-region="tool_activitydates-previewtable" data-formid="{{formid}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="tablefingerprint" form="{{formid}}" value="{{fingerprint}}">
    <div data-region="tool_activitydates-stale" class="alert alert-warning" role="status" hidden>{{#str}}tablestale, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table table-hover table-bordered table-striped">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>
                            <input type="checkbox" name="selectall" id="id_selectall"
                                title="{{#str}}toggleselection, tool_activitydates{{/str}}">
                        </th>
                        <th class="col-md-0">{{#str}}name{{/str}}</th>
                        <th class="col-md-3">{{#str}}description{{/str}}</th>
                        {{#showquestioncount}}
                            <th class="col-md-1">{{#str}}questioncount, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</th>
                        {{/showquestioncount}}
                        <th class="col-md-2">{{#str}}current, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</th>
                        <th>{{#str}}open, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</th>
                        {{#hasdue}}
                            <th>{{#str}}due, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</th>
                        {{/hasdue}}
                        <th>{{#str}}close, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{^tabledata}}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{{colcount}}">{{#str}}nomodulesincourse, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{/tabledata}}
                    {{#tabledata}}
                        {{#isheader}}
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="{{colcount}}">
                                    {{#dates}}
                                        {{#str}}session, tool_activitydates{{/str}} {{sessionnumber}}:
                                        <time datetime="{{startattr}}">{{startformatted}}</time>
                                        &ndash;
                                        <time datetime="{{endattr}}">{{endformatted}}</time>
                                    {{/dates}}
                                    {{^dates}}
                                        {{#str}}session, tool_activitydates{{/str}} &mdash;
                                    {{/dates}}
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        {{/isheader}}
                        {{^isheader}}
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <input type="checkbox" name="select" id="id_cmid_{{id}}"
                                        aria-label="{{name}}" {{selected}}>
                                </td>
                                <td><a href="{{config.wwwroot}}/mod/{{modname}}/view.php?id={{id}}">{{name}}</a></td>
                                <td>{{intro}}</td>
                                {{#showquestioncount}}
                                    <td>{{questioncount}}</td>
                                {{/showquestioncount}}
                                <td>
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="text-muted">{{#str}}open, tool_activitydates{{/str}}:</span>
                                        {{#timeopen}}<time datetime="{{timeopenattr}}">{{timeopenformatted}}</time>{{/timeopen}}
                                        {{^timeopen}}&mdash;{{/timeopen}}
                                    </div>
                                    {{#hasdue}}
                                        <div>
                                            <span class="text-muted">{{#str}}due, tool_activitydates{{/str}}:</span>
                                            {{#duedate}}<time datetime="{{duedateattr}}">{{duedateformatted}}</time>{{/duedate}}
                                            {{^duedate}}&mdash;{{/duedate}}
                                        </div>
                                    {{/hasdue}}
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="text-muted">{{#str}}close, tool_activitydates{{/str}}:</span>
                                        {{#timeclose}}<time datetime="{{timecloseattr}}">{{timecloseformatted}}</time>{{/timeclose}}
                                        {{^timeclose}}&mdash;{{/timeclose}}
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                {{#editable}}
                                    <td>
                                        <input type="datetime-local" class="form-control{{#timeopeninvalid}} is-invalid{{/timeopeninvalid}}"
                                            name="timeopen_rows[{{id}}]" form="{{formid}}" value="{{timeopenvalue}}"
                                            data-cmid="{{id}}" data-field="timeopen"
                                            id="tool_activitydates_timeopen_{{id}}"
                                            aria-describedby="tool_activitydates_timeopen_{{id}}_hint"
                                            aria-label="{{#str}}open, tool_activitydates{{/str}}: {{name}}">
                                        <div class="invalid-feedback" data-region="tool_activitydates-hint" data-cmid="{{id}}"
                                            data-field="timeopen" id="tool_activitydates_timeopen_{{id}}_hint">{{timeopenerror}}</div>
                                    </td>
                                    {{#hasdue}}
                                        <td>
                                            <input type="datetime-local" class="form-control{{#duedateinvalid}} is-invalid{{/duedateinvalid}}"
                                                name="duedate_rows[{{id}}]" form="{{formid}}" value="{{duedatevalue}}"
                                                data-cmid="{{id}}" data-field="duedate"
                                                id="tool_activitydates_duedate_{{id}}"
                                                aria-describedby="tool_activitydates_duedate_{{id}}_hint"
                                                aria-label="{{#str}}due, tool_activitydates{{/str}}: {{name}}">
                                            <div class="invalid-feedback" data-region="tool_activitydates-hint" data-cmid="{{id}}"
                                                data-field="duedate" id="tool_activitydates_duedate_{{id}}_hint">{{duedateerror}}</div>
                                        </td>
                                    {{/hasdue}}
                                    <td>
                                        <input type="datetime-local" class="form-control{{#timecloseinvalid}} is-invalid{{/timecloseinvalid}}"
                                            name="timeclose_rows[{{id}}]" form="{{formid}}" value="{{timeclosevalue}}"
                                            data-cmid="{{id}}" data-field="timeclose"
                                            id="tool_activitydates_timeclose_{{id}}"
                                            aria-describedby="tool_activitydates_timeclose_{{id}}_hint"
                                            aria-label="{{#str}}close, tool_activitydates{{/str}}: {{name}}">
                                        <div class="invalid-feedback" data-region="tool_activitydates-hint" data-cmid="{{id}}"
                                            data-field="timeclose" id="tool_activitydates_timeclose_{{id}}_hint">{{timecloseerror}}</div>
                                    </td>
                                {{/editable}}
                                {{^editable}}
                                    <td colspan="{{editcolspan}}">{{statustext}}</td>
                                {{/editable}}
                            </tr>
                        {{/isheader}}
                    {{/tabledata}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
